OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FLargely dry and bright with
OL,6,Fspells of sunshine for much of the
OL,7,Fday. Turning cloudier later with some
OL,8,Frain and stronger winds moving in
OL,9,Ftowards dusk. Temperatures near
OL,10,Faverage.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,13,FSunshine and blustery showers on
OL,14,FTuesday, although showers easing
OL,15,Flater. Mostly fine and dry Wednesday,
OL,16,Fbefore some patchy rain arrives
OL,17,Fthroughout Thursday. Feeling rather
OL,18,Fcool for the time of year.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
